block head
    title Disbiosis - Plants Cause Disease

block content
    h1 Disbiosis
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dysbiosis") Wikipedia]:
    blockquote Dysbiosis (also called dysbacteriosis) is characterized by a disruption to the microbiome resulting in an imbalance in the microbiota, changes in their functional composition and metabolic activities, or a shift in their local distribution.
